[{"title":"汕头海关歌寄伯瑶","author":"丘逢甲","text":"风雷驱鳄出海地，通商口开远人至。\n黄沙幻作锦绣场，白日腾上金银气。\n峨峨新旧两海关，旧关尚属旗官治。\n先生在关非关吏，我欲从之问关事。\n新关主者伊何人？\n短衣戴笠胡羊鼻。\n新关税赢旧关绌，关吏持筹岁能记。\n新关税入馀百万，中朝取之偿国债。\n日日洋轮出入口，红头旧船十九废。\n土货税重洋货轻，此法已难相抵制。\n况持岁价两相较，出口货惟十之二。\n入口岁赢二千万，曷怪民财日穷匮。\n惟潮出口糖大宗，颇闻近亦鲜溢利。\n西人嗜糖嗜其白，贱卖赤砂改机制。\n年来仿制土货多，各口华商商务坠。\n如何我不制洋货，老生抵死雠机器。\n或言官实掣商肘，机厂欲开预防累。\n此语或真吾不信，祗怪华商少雄志。\n坐令洋货日报关，万巧千奇无不备。\n以其货来以人往，大舱迫窄不能位。\n岁十万人出此关，偻指来归十无四。\n十万人中人彘半，载往作工仰喂饲。\n可怜生死落人手，不信造物人为贵。\n中朝屡诏言保商，惜无人陈保工议。\n我工我商皆可怜，强弱岂非随国势？\n不然十丈黄龙旗，何尝我国无公使？\n彼来待以至优礼，我往竟成反比例。\n且看西人领事权，雷厉风行来照会。\n大官小吏咸朒缩，左华右洋日张示。\n华商半悬他国旗，报关但用横行字。\n其中大驵尤狡狯，播弄高权遽横恣。\n商誇洋籍民洋教，时事年来多怪异。\n先生在关虽见惯，思之应下哀时泪。\n闽粤中间此片土，商务蒸蒸岁逾岁。\n瓜分之图日见报，定有旁人思攘臂。\n关前关后十万家，利窟沉酣如梦寐。\n先王古训言先醒，可能呼起通国睡。\n出门莽莽多风尘，无奈天公亦沉醉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32588,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"四月十六夜东山与台客话月","author":"丘逢甲","text":"万事应教付酒杯，眼看云合又云开。\n中天月色雨馀好，大海潮声风送来。\n人物祗今思故国，江山从古属雄才。\n飘零剩有乡心在，夜半骑鲸梦渡台。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32589,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"天地","author":"丘逢甲","text":"天地道方否，人才散于野。\n遭时乃云合，岂有平生雅？\n英雄造世宙，其才自天假。\n书或仅上口，名或不能写。\n古来真英雄，屈指几儒者？\n文人习目论，动叹人才寡。\n我自不英雄，奈何责天下！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32590,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟过韩江有寄","author":"丘逢甲","text":"此水东来我西上，扁舟北过江上城。\n南风正利不得泊，良夜相思空月明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32591,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画","author":"丘逢甲","text":"奇峰面面入层云，长板桥西坐夕曛。\n秋水一篙山九曲，放船同访武夷君。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32592,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"客怀","author":"丘逢甲","text":"古树半秋色，西风吹客怀。\n呼童扫不尽，落叶满閒阶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32593,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟发新步","author":"丘逢甲","text":"金鞍寨下溪水流，石鼓潭边雨乍收。\n一叶扁舟载斜日，泽兰花发古堤秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32594,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"为潮人士衍说孔教于鮀浦，伯瑶见访有诗，次韵答之","author":"丘逢甲","text":"大海潮来独倚栏，七千里外冷朝官。\n重提孔子尊王义，如日中天万象看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32595,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"王晓沧将之官闽中赋别 其一","author":"丘逢甲","text":"六龙尚未西巡日，海外曾开万寿宫。\n圣主回銮臣听鼓，一官千里入闽中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32596,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"王晓沧将之官闽中赋别 其二","author":"丘逢甲","text":"颇闻新政议裁官，何事卑栖令尉间？\n毕竟才人裁不得，要将诗界拓闽山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32597,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"王晓沧将之官闽中赋别 其三","author":"丘逢甲","text":"有人图写闽山去，著色争誇势力圈。\n泪洒君家故王墓，萧萧松柏锁寒烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32598,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"王晓沧将之官闽中赋别 其四","author":"丘逢甲","text":"马江虽败船政在，战后依然用法人。\n二十年来海权尽，浪抛财力铸官轮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32599,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"王晓沧将之官闽中赋别 其五","author":"丘逢甲","text":"鼓山东望龙渡处，海雨曾飘开国旗。\n从古英雄论成败，不堪重话共和时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32600,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"王晓沧将之官闽中赋别 其六","author":"丘逢甲","text":"海山莽莽送君行，海水茫茫无限情。\n未敢宝刀轻脱赠，恐教添作不平鸣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32601,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"重送王晓沧次前韵 其一","author":"丘逢甲","text":"江山霸气消沉尽，何处闽王有故宫？\n独客寻师海天去，无诸城郭夕阳中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32602,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"重送王晓沧次前韵 其二","author":"丘逢甲","text":"才人从古不宜官，置汝髯参短簿间。\n北望中原数豪杰，左旗右鼓眼中山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32603,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"重送王晓沧次前韵 其三","author":"丘逢甲","text":"一官便具奴才性，谁是英雄出此圈。\n且合看山持手版，钓龙台上啸寒烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32604,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"重送王晓沧次前韵 其四","author":"丘逢甲","text":"竞争世界论天演，此去闽中太有人。\n唤起群龙听梵唱，诸天同转法王轮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32605,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"重送王晓沧次前韵 其五","author":"丘逢甲","text":"开遍岭梅日长至，霏霏寒雨飘船旗。\n诗中长记送君日，此是人天剥复时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32606,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"重送王晓沧次前韵 其六","author":"丘逢甲","text":"落日浮云送客行，旧游回首不胜情。\n海山俦侣如相问，大鸟三年尚不鸣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32607,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岁暮感怀次感春韵 其一","author":"丘逢甲","text":"浪说芦灰止水年，笙簧重奏古来天。\n阳枢不转春消息，老木寒巢噤帝鹃。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32608,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岁暮感怀次感春韵 其二","author":"丘逢甲","text":"玉龙残甲满天飞，万里寒光照铁衣。\n黄竹歌中行八骏，瑶池空送穆王归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32609,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岁暮感怀次感春韵 其三","author":"丘逢甲","text":"扁舟钓雪下寒滩，落日荒荒欲霁难。\n满目江山沉战气，可能王业不偏安。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32610,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岁暮感怀次感春韵 其四","author":"丘逢甲","text":"曾从剑侠传中来，十万戈船梦里开。\n把酒寒斋逢故部，海东残岛话奇莱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32611,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岁暮感怀次感春韵 其五","author":"丘逢甲","text":"万梅花里问前身，我佛从来戒造因。\n冷看天倾无力补，莫将黄土浪抟人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32612,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岁暮感怀次感春韵 其六","author":"丘逢甲","text":"禾黍何须怨狡童，是非从古论难公。\n可怜神化丹青手，剩粉零缣写北风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32613,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次韵答伯瑶","author":"丘逢甲","text":"门外大海生春涛，海山矗立如墙高。\n款门何人曳春袍！\n兰陵夫子今诗豪。\n海山自苍海水绿，对客挥毫洒珠玉。\n杜陵乐府老更成，休作开元天宝声！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32614,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苦旱 其一","author":"丘逢甲","text":"手无寸铁诛妖魃，安得神龙出九渊？\n但解乘球用今法，不妨持药炸青天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32615,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苦旱 其二","author":"丘逢甲","text":"眼中赤地真千里，万首翘天望雨来。\n谁叩九阊讼风伯，新云才起又吹开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32616,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"喜谢颂臣由台至","author":"丘逢甲","text":"鸡黍三年约，莺花二月时。\n春随故人至，书慰老亲思。\n海上惊相见，山中喜可知。\n春篘酒方熟，莫遽数归期。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32617,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次韵答宾南金陵","author":"丘逢甲","text":"杨柳依依白下门，梅花历历岭头村。\n南来驿信春同到，北去班声夜尚喧。\n清酒黄龙半要约，素车白马几忠魂！\n与君别后论身世，除却悲歌百不存。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32618,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次韵再答宾南，兼寄陈伯严 其一","author":"丘逢甲","text":"如此江山客闭门，有人相忆向蛮村。\n神龙睡任群鱼泣，病骥喑看万马喧。\n抚剑已怜消侠骨，选蓍重与揲归魂。\n萧条炎运人才尽，差喜陈蕃榻尚存。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32619,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次韵再答宾南，兼寄陈伯严 其二","author":"丘逢甲","text":"故乡投足向何门，丁水南来绕古村。\n华表鹤归山月暗，神州鳌没海涛喧。\n竞争世界怜天演，寥落中原怆国魂。\n手把英雄传閒读，眼中多少可儿存！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32620,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次韵再答宾南，兼寄陈伯严 其三","author":"丘逢甲","text":"遥怜驻马望千门，人在江南黄叶村。\n鼠璞殊方名未定，蚊雷竟夕语何喧！\n心关国粹谋兴学，目笑时流说重魂。\n庚子陈经拜宣圣，尊王遗义故应存。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32621,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次韵再答宾南，兼寄陈伯严 其四","author":"丘逢甲","text":"南戒河山走越门，布衣牢落此荒村。\n望中残照金轮转，意外虚声瓦缶喧。\n敢信群龙终见首，竟烦大鸟屡招魂。\n重阴天气怀人日，展卷吾庐春自存。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32622,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与颂丞话台事","author":"丘逢甲","text":"万三千尺出海面，岛国诸山无此高。\n谁遣黄图易他色，空传赤制属吾曹。\n梦中雄鬼哀相吊，劫后顽仙笑独逃。\n收拾磨崖纪功笔，东南风急送春涛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32623,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书感与颂丞","author":"丘逢甲","text":"各自行营高敞地，大宛山与大屏邻。\n生儿莫作真王想，不及淮阴守冢人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32624,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"论诗次铁庐韵 其一","author":"丘逢甲","text":"元音从古本天生，何事时流务竞争？\n诗世界中几雄国？\n惜无人起与连衡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32625,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"论诗次铁庐韵 其二","author":"丘逢甲","text":"迩来诗界唱革命，谁果独尊吾未逢。\n流尽玄黄笔头血，茫茫词海战群龙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32626,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"论诗次铁庐韵 其三","author":"丘逢甲","text":"新筑诗中大舞台，侏儒几辈剧堪哀。\n即今开幕推神手，要选人天绝代才。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32627,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"论诗次铁庐韵 其四","author":"丘逢甲","text":"台上风云发浩歌，不须猛士再蒐罗。\n拔山妄费重瞳力，夜半虞兮唱奈何。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32628,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"论诗次铁庐韵 其五","author":"丘逢甲","text":"北派南宗各自誇，可能流响脱淫哇。\n诗中果有真王在，四海何妨共一家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32629,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"论诗次铁庐韵 其六","author":"丘逢甲","text":"彼此纷纷说界疆，谁知世有大文章。\n中天北斗都无定，浮海观星上大郎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32630,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"论诗次铁庐韵 其七","author":"丘逢甲","text":"芭蕉雪里供摹写，绝妙能诗王右丞。\n米雨欧风作吟料，岂同隆古事无徵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32631,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"论诗次铁庐韵 其八","author":"丘逢甲","text":"四海横流未定居，千村万落废犁锄。\n荆州失后吟梁父，空忆南阳旧草庐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32632,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"论诗次铁庐韵 其九","author":"丘逢甲","text":"展卷重吟民主篇，海山东望独悽然。\n英雄成败凭人论，赢得诗中自纪年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32633,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"论诗次铁庐韵 其十","author":"丘逢甲","text":"四海都知有蛰庵，重开诗史作雄谈。\n大禽大兽今何世？\n目极全球战正酣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32634,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送谢四东归","author":"丘逢甲","text":"故人访我东海来，春风万里心颜开。\n故人别我东海去，临歧各短英雄气。\n七年不见今再见，沧海桑田事万变。\n中间不变故人心，袖手海天看龙战。\n君来一月无停车，访我更访山中庐。\n老亲喜君送君出，来此十日相同居。\n七年乃有此十日，但觉日行比常疾。\n此日不为君我留，南风日日催行舟。\n舟行既速况有轮，轮转四海扬胡尘。\n送君此去作胡语，乐府休唱胡无人。\n我年方强君未老，惜君投身隐海岛。\n亚洲大陆局日新，时势径待英雄造。\n海山之高一万三千尺，当年弃去良可惜。\n横来不王复不侯，为我归言岛中客。\n包胥存楚约可寻，廉颇用赵原初心。\n相期亚陆风云再相见，骑鲸东海来挽神州沉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32635,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纪兴宁妇女改妆事与刘生松龄二首 其一","author":"丘逢甲","text":"山川奇伟数齐昌，不独男儿解自强。\n要使金闺兴女学，银钗先改峒蛮妆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32636,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纪兴宁妇女改妆事与刘生松龄二首 其二","author":"丘逢甲","text":"维新殊有九州风，新绾盘蛇髻更工。\n预祝英雄出巾帼，武婆城在碧云中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32637,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次韵答维卿师 其一","author":"丘逢甲","text":"流落天南今八载，接天海气昼昏昏。\n锦袍银烛追前梦，夜半涛声倍断魂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32638,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次韵答维卿师 其二","author":"丘逢甲","text":"空存扶汉分章手，无计能开日月昏。\n独立苍茫发遐想，自由钟起国民魂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32639,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画四绝句 其一","author":"丘逢甲","text":"漫天飞雪净红尘，吩咐门前扫雪人：要向梅花问消息，空山已放几分春？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32640,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画四绝句 其二","author":"丘逢甲","text":"多时放牧出天閒，边事无功马自閒。\n杨柳千条溪一曲，可怜神骏老空山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32641,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画四绝句 其三","author":"丘逢甲","text":"遮天浓碧老梧桐，曾种前皇旧上宫。\n凤鸟不来人事改，箫声閒度月明中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32642,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画四绝句 其四","author":"丘逢甲","text":"閒敲棋子向山中，不信神仙万念空。\n一局松阴未收著，人间成败几英雄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32643,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画芙蓉","author":"丘逢甲","text":"曾记花间倚醉眠，露寒风定月娟娟。\n画中重见芙蓉面，酒冷香消忆少年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32644,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄台湾栎社诸子，兼怀颂丞二首 其一","author":"丘逢甲","text":"柏庄谁拾燹馀文，栎社重张劫后军。\n九十九峰依旧好，尽携豪笔写秋云。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32645,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄台湾栎社诸子，兼怀颂丞二首 其二","author":"丘逢甲","text":"月泉志卷凭谁定，还待当时晞发人。\n遥忆参军谢皋羽，西台朱鸟独伤神。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32646,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题兰史罗浮纪游图","author":"丘逢甲","text":"我阅世界大地图，罗浮一点乃在南岭之南隅。\n神禹伯益导焚所未到，发见乃始汉家使者中大夫。\n二千馀年在世界，为山主者仙之儒。\n洞天福地收不尽，许容黄面瞿昙徒。\n霸者之宫贼巢穴，仙山时亦遭点污。\n游人迁客更多事，往往镌刻伤山肤。\n沉迷诗酒发幻想，或突神女搪仙姑。\n梅花无言翠羽笑，梦中彼美颜何姝？\n天公应悔蓬莱割左股，隳落欲界非仙都。\n迩来仙人所治地益窄，堑山跨海来群胡。\n各思圈地逞势力，此邦多宝尤觊觎。\n此时傥有豪杰出，岂能揖让无征诛！\n此时若作厌世想，纵成仙去胡为乎？\n潘生昔游半球万里路，海山看尽呼归桴。\n中间锡兰岛上逢佛睡，一任释种为人奴。\n佛犹如此仙可想，但有沉醉醪何酥。\n仙人醉生佛梦死，世间学者宁非愚。\n留名山石石且枯，岂有丹青能不逾？\n人生若作千秋万岁想，固应自立昂藏躯。\n黄河、扬子、珠江判流域，文明之运方南趋。\n天道由来后起胜，以中證外原非诬。\n但须世界有豪杰，太极虽倒人能扶。\n南界之山走百粤，如罗浮者雄非粗。\n奇峰四百瀑九百，慎勿但作诗人娱。\n上有神桂下有湖，洞中仙蝶不可呼。\n题君此图正风雨，想见罗浮离合云模糊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32647,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梦题岳阳楼壁","author":"丘逢甲","text":"梦拥灵旗宝纛行，鸾骖小驻岳阳城。\n濛濛云气开南极，浩浩江流作楚声。\n衡岳雁归秋万里，洞庭龙卧月三更。\n他年记取题诗处，南纪群真抗手迎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32648,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次韵答友人 其一","author":"丘逢甲","text":"天遣诸夷不乱华，自应骠骑不为家。\n独怜已似骑驴将，閒看西湖十里花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32649,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次韵答友人 其二","author":"丘逢甲","text":"傥容儒术济时艰，老抱遗经岂听閒。\n河镇未归金世界，大师犹解荐龟山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32650,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次韵答友人 其三","author":"丘逢甲","text":"庾信江南早赋哀，平生萧瑟漫论才。\n百王道尽焚书日，谁遣窥江虏马来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32651,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次韵答友人 其四","author":"丘逢甲","text":"遣日将诗也自宜，故乡犹幸有新知。\n吟成自漉炉头酒，权当黄龙痛饮时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32652,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"饮镇平都司署赏菊，为题宋人所画报捷图","author":"丘逢甲","text":"已过重阳菊尚开，霜天赏菊此衔杯。\n人饶韬略来香国，花亦英雄上将台。\n粤水闽山文武会，酒龙诗虎主宾才。\n西风吹解黄金甲，醉看红旗报捷来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":32653,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]